{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004720.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004718.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004719.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is currently in demo version. </i> <br><i>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended. </i> <br><i>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your feedback is always welcome. </i> <br><i>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779940?t=1749387933","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/6b6bc0c9c80c5e8cbdc1f324bceb79ab122aa0ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749387933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/7f521c01f99c10eae5d246bf38bb8af3711a959e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749387933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/7f521c01f99c10eae5d246bf38bb8af3711a959e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749387933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004720.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004718.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/extras/Group_1000004719.png?t=1749387933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is currently in demo version. </i> <br><i>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended. </i> <br><i>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your feedback is always welcome. </i> <br><i>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>","developers":["PPPG"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3622610","name":"Chord: The Loudest Hero"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779940/40f306508f412b8f510cf00eba5ac934351137b2/header.jpg?t=1749387933","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><b